  "title": "Gevo Announces Appointment of Todd Werpy to Board of Directors",
  "summary": "ENGLEWOOD, Colo., July 16, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- Gevo, Inc. (NASDAQ: GEVO), a leader in renewable fuels, chemicals and carbon management, today announced the appointment of Todd Werpy, Ph.D. to its Board of Directors. Werpy brings more than three decades of innovation and executive leadership",
